  {
   "text": "Nora wanted the summit at sunrise,",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.244
  },
  {
   "text": "so she started at six, in full dark, with a road walk to the trailhead.",
   "start": 2.394,
   "end": 6.384
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: headlamp on before you leave the car,",
   "start": 6.684,
   "end": 9.139
  },
  {
   "text": "and a light on your back for the road.",
   "start": 9.239,
   "end": 10.859
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for dark mornings.",
   "start": 11.159,
   "end": 12.736
  }
